# IMITATION-FIRST: recording-only overlay (2026-11-04). The expert overlay
# (il_expert.env, which the fine-tune also uses) plus one recording fix.
#
# GOAL_KEEP_ON_PASS=1: the env must not move the goal while the expert drives
# to it. Without it the env resamples the goal whenever the car enters the 2 m
# radius, at any speed -- 137 times in the 12-episode diagnostic (job 463139).
# The expert entered at 10-12 km/h, the goal moved, and it then came to rest
# 0.3 m from the ORIGINAL goal at 6-9 km/h, an arrival nobody scored. In
# recorded data that would also pair the goal image with a place the env no
# longer pays for. Recording only: training keeps v30's resample, which v38
# showed it leans on.
. "$REPO/slurm/il_expert.env"
export GOAL_KEEP_ON_PASS=1
